 for pounding, a cloud\" -> Landscape (mountain, rock), also tools-materials? Stone for pounding is a tool. Also cloud: sky-weather. So [landscape, tools-materials, sky-weather].\n\n66. id: 52b8f68e-7fb0-4db6-97b7-60079626e360, lemma: adṛṣṭa, gloss: \"unseen, not experienced, unreal\" -> This is abstract. Could be phi-moksha? Unreal is philosophical. So [phi-moksha].\n\n67. id: 655f1a8f-8126-40e9-bd93-1967726e949c, lemma: adṛśya, gloss: \"invisible, not seen, latent\" -> Same, phi-moksha. [phi-moksha].\n\n68. id: 5a0711d1-b31e-4331-807c-956bca7e2563, lemma: adya, gloss: \"today, now\" -> Time. [time-seasons].\n\n69. id: 1f1ccb9f-d424-4471-aa91-305d7e390c88, lemma: ādya, gloss: \"being at the beginning, the first\" -> Time/order. So time-seasons. Also quantity-number? First is ordinal. So [time-seasons, quantity-number].\n\n70. id: 2bc40e33-2c92-4931-ba5e-c7a46c7fa4fb, lemma: agada, gloss: \"а medicine, antidote\" -> This is a substance. Could be tools-materials? Medicine is a material. Also maybe food-drink? No. So [tools-materials].\n\n71. id: 46ad7178-deee-49f1-a33d-87a026931b2b, lemma: āgama, gloss: \"study, knowledge, tradition\" -> Learning. [learning].\n\n72. id: 8bd11a74-14ab-4b8a-bf71-316a26d5b483, lemma: āgama, gloss: \"acquisition\" -> This is an action. Could be physical-action? Acquisition is not physical necessarily. Maybe none.\n\n73. id: 3716a4c0-0d76-4608-ace3-fd867247fe77, lemma: āgama, gloss: \"arrival\" -> Motion-verbs? Arrival is motion. So [motion-verbs].\n\n74. id: 37d1b94f-8a89-4747-a466-e4de6a2b8c22, lemma: āgamana, gloss: \"arrival, returning\" -> Motion-verbs. [motion-verbs].\n\n75. id: 954fcde4-5349-44f3-98b3-632dda51fc68, lemma: āgāra, gloss: \"an apartment, house\" -> House-dwelling. [house-dwelling].\n\n76. id: aab41fdb-2c82-4fde-b72b-c73eb160ac38, lemma: agha, gloss: \"an evil, harm, sin\" -> This is negative. Could be emotions-negative? Not emotion. Law-rule? Sin is religious/legal. Also phi-moksha? Sin is philosophical. So [law-rule, phi-moksha].\n\n77. id: 3545c117-9fbb-4c93-8592-aae1092728a8, lemma: agha, gloss: \"evil, bad, sinful\" -> Adjective. Same categories: law-rule, phi-moksha. [law-rule, phi-moksha].\n\n78. id: 1c9f0f62-172c-476a-9faa-f6192891115a, lemma: agni, gloss: \"fire, the god of fire\" -> Fire is a natural element? Could be sky-weather? Not exactly. Also ritual-worship? God of fire is ritual. So [ritual-worship]. Also maybe tools-materials? Fire is used as tool. But better ritual.\n\n79. id: f7c02392-93d1-416b-8f7d-ac0cf7944869, lemma: agnihotra, gloss: \"an oblation to Agni\" -> Ritual-worship. [ritual-worship].\n\n80. id: 2683a25c-4535-4c77-b348-574b8dd11a99, lemma: agra, gloss: \"-° a. chief, excellent\" -> This is an adjective meaning excellent. Could be emotions-positive? Not emotion. Quantity-number? No. None.\n\n81. id: 673bd8dd-dcb1-4fec-90b7-ef32f341ea27, lemma: agra, gloss: \"а tip, summit, beginning\" -> Space-direction? Tip is spatial. Also time? Beginning. So [space-direction, time-seasons].\n\n82. id: e7917dcc-9cf5-476d-bda1-149a141fbf9c, lemma: agratas, gloss: \"before\" -> Space-direction (in front) and time (before). So [space-direction, time-seasons].\n\n83. id: b0f67b5a-ed19-49f4-957c-22ed7a48777f, lemma: agre, gloss: \"at first, in the beginning, in front\" -> Same. [space-direction, time-seasons].\n\n84. id: 2d08369f-7f35-457d-be60-ee23bfb29457, lemma: ah, gloss: \"to say, speak, signify, call, consider\" -> Speech-acts. Also thought-memory? Consider is thought. So [speech-acts, thought-memory].\n\n85. id: 43957fc4-b839-4f04-9b9e-ca0e5d4fe0f5, lemma: aha, gloss: \"certainly, namely\" -> This is an adverb. Not a category. None.\n\n86. id: a0677ded-a72c-4bf2-ac1f-bfd474f2d7ae, lemma: āhāra, gloss: \"taking (food), food\" -> Food-drink. Also physical-action? Taking is action. So [food-drink, physical-action].\n\n87. id: 15063ec8-e8cf-4ada-8b0c-556cdb0d2b3d, lemma: āhava, gloss: \"challenge, battle\" -> War-conflict. [war-conflict].\n\n88. id: 2f29f2e0-fff6-43b4-8dd6-2ee970714927, lemma: ahi, gloss: \"a snake, dragon (demon)\" -> Animals (snake). Also maybe war? Dragon demon is mythical. So [animals].\n\n89. id: 23f8758f-acd8-4859-adbf-73a5339b1309, lemma: ahiṃsā, gloss: \"not injuring anything\" -> This is a principle. Could be phi-moksha? Ahimsa is philosophical/ethical. So [phi-moksha].\n\n90. id: a962ef13-490b-4829-8d67-a29e7280a880, lemma: ahita, gloss: \"evil\" -> Same as agha. Law-rule, phi-moksha. [law-rule, phi-moksha].\n\n91. id: b951b023-957f-4a05-beb2-1b232ea12779, lemma: ahita, gloss: \"enemy\" -> Social-relations? Enemy is a social relation (negative). Also war-conflict. So [social-relations, war-conflict].\n\n92. id: 93c7ae79-b090-455b-bad6-a6acd3fdfc37, lemma: ahita, gloss: \"improper, obnoxious, bad, hostile\" -> Adjective. Law-rule? Improper. Also emotions-negative? Hostile is negative. So [law-rule, emotions-negative].\n\n93. id: f804642f-6db7-4bbd-9e2f-80ec4ef3fe06, lemma: aho, gloss: \"implying joy, sorrow, praise, contempt\" -> This is an interjection expressing emotions. So emotions-positive (joy, praise) and emotions-negative (sorrow, contempt). So both. [emotions-positive, emotions-negative].\n\n94. id: 34428ab7-61a4-4957-acdd-77127119e2f8, lemma: ahorātra, gloss: \"а day and night\" -> Time-seasons. [time-seasons].\n\n95. id: 5b5e379a-926f-4a0f-86b2-8509f4f12bed, lemma: āhuti, gloss: \"offering, libation\" -> Ritual-worship. [ritual-worship].\n\n96. id: 0147feaf-a40c-48a9-a74e-8423eb205b05, lemma: aiśvarya, gloss: \"supremacy, sovereignty, power\" -> Law-rule. Also social-relations? Power is social. So [law-rule, social-relations].\n\n97. id: 9e45e109-3c43-49af-9074-d9a620f1dd1f, lemma: aja, gloss: \"a he-goat\" -> Animals. [animals].\n\n98. id: 15184df8-9c9d-421f-a773-eea07d5f4f81, lemma: ajā, gloss: \"a she-goat\" -> Animals. [animals].\n\n99. id: 82fa2309-ced9-4247-86ec-da1d659ee8f8, lemma: ajita, gloss: \"not conquered, invincible\" -> This is a state. War-conflict? Invincible in war. So [war-conflict].\n\n100. id: 4be1b619-5944-4567-a46f-534c289e1716, lemma: ājñā, gloss: \"order, command\" -> Speech-acts (command). Also law-rule? Order is authoritative. So [speech-acts, law-rule].\n\n101. id: 8027d9ee-53ed-4e82-9537-fc7e8a00c764, lemma: ajñāna, gloss: \"abl. unawares\" -> This is an adverb? \"unawares\" means without knowledge. Could be thought-memory? Lack of knowledge. So [thought-memory]? But \"unawares\" is not a noun. Maybe none.\n\n102. id: 0a4f139d-bfc5-4bf0-98e8-76aaa91329b6, lemma: ajñāna, gloss: \"non-cognizance, ignorance\" -> Thought-memory? Ignorance is lack of knowledge. Also learning? So [thought-memory, learning].\n\n103. id: 044e57eb-9277-436e-a58e-ecf4ded9c800, lemma: akāla, gloss: \"а wrong time, not а right time\" -> Time-seasons. [time-seasons].\n\n104. id: 1be80ea2-a706-41a9-97f0-df58c185d964, lemma: akāma, gloss: \"without desire, unwilling\" -> Desire-will? Lack of desire. So [desire-will].\n\n105. id: 4c372d30-6c84-415b-8b44-84de78f24c90, lemma: ākara, gloss: \"heap, multitude, a mine\" -> Quantity-number? Heap is quantity. Also landscape? Mine is a place. So [quantity-number, landscape].\n\n106. id: 84e45b61-d0d0-459b-ac23-6661bf1b5825, lemma: ākāra, gloss: \"form, stature, appearance\" -> Senses? Appearance is visual. But senses category is about organs. Maybe none.\n\n107. id: 3390d36b-3093-4343-935e-eecd4ae6e867, lemma: ākarṇay, gloss: \"to give ear to, hear\" -> Senses (hearing). Also speech-acts? Listening is not speech. So [senses].\n\n108. id: 8e9811d9-94e5-42c7-bb20-bb4fe95042b3, lemma: ākāśa, gloss: \"а free space, atmosphere, ether\" -> Sky-weather? Atmosphere. Also space-direction? Space. So [sky-weather, space-direction].\n\n109. id: c36ed600-2a4a-43e3-ba7e-51ac2465cdd6, lemma: akasmāt, gloss: \"unexpectedly, suddenly\" -> Time? Suddenly is temporal. So [time-seasons].\n\n110. id: 4f50282e-00f0-49a5-a297-d16dbc71d9a5, lemma: akhila, gloss: \"having no gap, entire, all\" -> Quantity-number? Entire is quantity. So [quantity-number].\n\n111. id: abc2577a-c41b-45bd-8a04-3384bbdcc5bb, lemma: ākhya, gloss: \"called, named\" -> Naming-address. [naming-address].\n\n112. id: 32311197-5e1b-472c-b140-6afc3d7b7709, lemma: ākhyā, gloss: \"name\" -> Naming-address. [naming-address].\n\n113. id: 603e3b8c-c888-4178-9909-eb51025b47c4, lemma: ākhyāna, gloss: \"a tale, legend\" -> Speech-acts? Tale is a narrative. Also learning? Legend is knowledge. So [speech-acts, learning].\n\n114. id: 2f34fad9-ec6f-4c02-b14f-a755ba7cf42c, lemma: akliṣṭa, gloss: \"unwearied, indefatigable\" -> This is a state. Could be rest-stillness? Not really. None.\n\n115. id: 90d85f44-9c7b-4294-b229-d66f6b293217, lemma: akṣa, gloss: \"name of a demon\" -> This is a proper name. Could be war? Demon is a being. Not clear. None.\n\n116. id: ef001004-7fdf-4082-91f8-9a1891d7a3ba, lemma: akṣa, gloss: \"a die for gambling\" -> Tools-materials? Die is a tool. Also maybe social? Gambling is an activity. So [tools-materials].\n\n117. id: ce0f03bc-fa56-4b90-90a0-91cf5a7e6808, lemma: akṣara, gloss: \"a word, syllable\" -> Speech-acts? Word is speech. Also learning? Syllable is part of language. So [speech-acts, learning].\n\n118. id: 7da52545-4b79-4b78-87d4-9bf4af0deb76, lemma: akṣata, gloss: \"unhusked grains\" -> Food-drink? Grains are food. Also plants-trees? Grains are from plants. So [food-drink, plants-trees].\n\n119. id: bee197f9-e2c9-4ce1-9391-21f226423668, lemma: akṣata, gloss: \"not crushed, uninjured\" -> Adjective. None.\n\n120. id: 0ce945a1-4854-4935-8105-875319f74510, lemma: ākula, gloss: \"confounded, agitated, full\" -> Emotions-negative? Agitated is negative emotion. Also \"full\" is quantity. So [emotions-negative, quantity-number].\n\n121. id: 6c61e574-d0ac-407e-9f2f-d0bf82cf0de7, lemma: ākūti, gloss: \"design, wish\" -> Desire-will? Wish is desire. Also thought-memory? Design is thought. So [desire-will, thought-memory].\n\n122. id: c32449bf-b7b1-44f2-b74b-a79693e8d2d2, lemma: alam, gloss: \"enough, sufficient, able\" -> Quantity-number? Enough is quantity. Also ability? Not a category. So [quantity-number].\n\n123. id: 1ccc7dde-96e4-478a-8cd8-4e1f41a526a2, lemma: alaṃkāra, gloss: \"decorating, ornament\" -> Garments? Ornament is garment. Also physical-action? Decorating is action. So [garments, physical-action].\n\n124. id: 37c1d421-52ce-4be6-9167-8b02da4ffe84, lemma: ālāpa, gloss: \"narration, conversation\" -> Speech-acts. [speech-acts].\n\n125. id: 5cceca2c-ff34-4519-a11b-58c455fb6318, lemma: ālaya, gloss: \"an abode, asylum\" -> House-dwelling. [house-dwelling].\n\n126. id: c34c52df-64d5-410a-84f1-8ce5f2cb7535, lemma: āloka, gloss: \"seeing, look, glance, sight\" -> Senses (sight). [senses].\n\n127. id: efc2bad5-3bd4-4963-81a4-8a0b27c4b4db, lemma: alpa, gloss: \"small, minute, unimportant\" -> Quantity-number? Small is quantity. So [quantity-number].\n\n128. id: afa3d3f2-45eb-4206-9a4d-0fd7ea58fdda, lemma: amara, gloss: \"a god\" -> Ritual-worship? Gods are worshipped. Also phi-moksha? Gods are philosophical. So [ritual-worship, phi-moksha].\n\n129. id: eb5d57cb-fba7-423a-b395-2dd715967b8e, lemma: amara, gloss: \"immortal\" -> Phi-moksha? Immortality is philosophical. So [phi-moksha].\n\n130. id: 2c77ecb8-a94b-42a8-8456-ee8a12c4e54e, lemma: amarṣa, gloss: \"non-endurance, indignation, anger\" -> Emotions-negative. [emotions-negative].\n\n131. id: df5dbbdb-2355-4e9c-8c37-ad4dc1db7696, lemma: amartya, gloss: \"immortal, imperishable\" -> Phi-moksha. [phi-moksha].\n\n132. id: cca0b56e-9526-4109-a107-ef2cae344cca, lemma: amātya, gloss: \"belonging to the same house, companion (of a king), minister\" -> Social-relations? Companion. Also professions? Minister. So [social-relations, professions].\n\n133. id: 4162658f-8eb2-4570-9d62-af3b67a9a422, lemma: ambara, gloss: \"\\\"surrouding\\\" = garment, sky\" -> Garments and sky-weather. So [garments, sky-weather].\n\n134. id: 6437b2ee-6398-4184-a93c-7c5e65025ab1, lemma: ambhas, gloss: \"water\" -> Water. [water].\n\n135. id: afb459e3-57d8-4a83-b737-02319858bae9, lemma: ambu, gloss: \"water\" -> Water. [water].\n\n136. id: 7ff45bdd-ce63-4c5c-b692-866abe1449c3, lemma: ambuda, gloss: \"a cloud\" -> Sky-weather. [sky-weather].\n\n137. id: e7abdd6d-0870-4355-9c86-da56d742fdff, lemma: aṃhas, gloss: \"anxiety, distress\" -> Emotions-negative. [emotions-negative].\n\n138. id: 1e0c59da-6ca0-400f-947c-544d92d06d80, lemma: amita, gloss: \"immense, unlimited\" -> Quantity-number? Immense is quantity. So [quantity-number].\n\n139. id: a2e53941-5b18-4c3b-a76b-11ec6a91027a, lemma: amitra, gloss: \"an enemy, foe\" -> Social-relations (negative), war-conflict. So [social-relations, war-conflict].\n\n140. id: dd0aafaf-1351-4da6-8d61-467da9f22f77, lemma: amogha, gloss: \"not vain, useful\" -> This is an adjective. None.\n\n141. id: 78c4445a-0f71-4117-9201-51aa1b958865, lemma: āmra, gloss: \"the fruit of the mango tree\" -> Food-drink (fruit). Also plants-trees. So [food-drink, plants-trees].\n\n142. id: 3953ddff-6308-4616-8f70-722b696a66ac, lemma: āmra, gloss: \"the mango tree\" -> Plants-trees. [plants-trees].\n\n143. id: 5dc79947-7477-4d1b-a1d0-6473e5bd38b5, lemma: amṛta, gloss: \"immortality, life, the nectar\" -> Phi-moksha (immortality). Also food-drink? Nectar is drink. So [phi-moksha, food-drink].\n\n144. id: abaa0ca6-b770-455b-ab79-7a0519aae6b4, lemma: amṛta, gloss: \"a god\" -> Ritual-worship, phi-moksha. [ritual-worship, phi-moksha].\n\n145. id: 46df1f89-3729-407e-a415-5191d1246e8a, lemma: amṛta, gloss: \"immortal\" -> Phi-moksha. [phi-moksha].\n\n146. id: d9df0eea-6640-4656-be71-c9769d820abe, lemma: aṃsa, gloss: \"the shoulder\" -> Body-parts. [body-parts].\n\n147. id: 4a435198-acc1-452f-89f9-9f9f41b3352a, lemma: aṃśa, gloss: \"a share, portion, part\" -> Quantity-number. [quantity-number].\n\n148. id: c795edf7-5d24-4f2f-ba94-ca58912d2dd3, lemma: aṃśumant, gloss: \"the sun\" -> Sky-weather. Also ritual? Sun deity. So [sky-weather, ritual-worship].\n\n149. id: 1475f930-d696-4df2-ad83-d56f50afcb4a, lemma: aṃśumant, gloss: \"rich in Soma, radiant\" -> Soma is a plant/drink. So plants-trees? Soma is a plant. Also food-drink? Soma juice. So [plants-trees, food-drink].\n\n150. id: 5d61c8f2-2c01-4ec7-a38f-075470b7a2e8, lemma: an, gloss: \"to breathe\" -> Physical-action? Breathing is physical. Also rest-stillness? Not really. So [physical-action].\n\n151. id: e6e7b4ce-f5e1-45b0-a585-21b5f8236a06, lemma: anāgata, gloss: \"not arrived, future\" -> Time-seasons (future). Also motion? Not arrived. So [time-seasons].\n\n152. id: cd00009b-9fc9-4e8e-b21f-cedddde9ae0f, lemma: anala, gloss: \"fire\" -> Could be ritual? Fire is used in ritual. Also natural element. But no category for fire specifically. Maybe tools-materials? Fire as tool. Or sky-weather? Not really. I'll assign ritual-worship because of sacrificial fire. Also maybe physical-action? No. So [ritual-worship].\n\n153. id: fa6e5758-d8db-4b5f-997a-b58b593ecac2, lemma: anāmaya, gloss: \"health\" -> This is a state. Could be emotions-positive? Health is positive. But not an emotion. None.\n\n154. id: 7eb9a7ee-dabc-4c61-bba1-71c87d770494, lemma: anāmaya, gloss: \"free from disease\" -> Same. None.\n\n155. id: 9faf7e83-5f59-4f6f-97e6-21d2c0ff40f7, lemma: ānana, gloss: \"the mouth, face\" -> Body-parts. [body-parts].\n\n156. id: 2d43e63d-3998-491f-83cd-d73d275401b4, lemma: ānanda, gloss: \"joy, pleasure, happiness\" -> Emotions-positive. [emotions-positive].\n\n157. id: b5fa2a9d-b37d-4cfb-9fcb-2e613947f9e4, lemma: anaṅga, gloss: \"passion\" -> Desire-will? Passion is strong desire. Also emotions-positive? Passion can be positive. So [desire-will, emotions-positive].\n\n158. id: 7dc5304b-bed8-4319-9b0f-1b7c03c59607, lemma: anaṅga, gloss: \"name of Kāma (god of love)\" -> Ritual-worship? God of love. Also desire-will? Love is desire. So [ritual-worship, desire-will].\n\n159. id: b34d8804-aa54-4004-9702-0d70954243a9, lemma: anaṅga, gloss: \"bodiless\" -> This is a state. Phi-moksha? Bodiless is philosophical. So [phi-moksha].\n\n160. id: 6c0b7b4b-8885-40d2-8479-aeb3131ca46c, lemma: ananta, gloss: \"endless, infinite\" -> Quantity-number? Infinite is quantity. Also phi-moksha? Infinity is philosophical. So [quantity-number, phi-moksha].\n\n161. id: f42ecbdb-42fb-42f8-874a-075e01d979b7, lemma: anantara, gloss: \"having no interval, uninterrupted, next\" -> Space-direction? No interval is spatial. Also time? Next is temporal. So [space-direction, time-seasons].\n\n162. id: 27e4f92a-59fb-4fca-9bdf-5ddfa72bef12, lemma: anantaram, gloss: \"immediately after, afterwards\" -> Time-seasons. [time-seasons].\n\n163. id: bea1e5d8-1994-4cc9-a417-a4214cb2cb1d, lemma: ananya, gloss: \"having no other\" -> This is a state. None.\n\n164. id: 55155076-2b43-4f50-92e0-611327592408, lemma: anartha, gloss: \"disadvantage, harm\" -> Emotions-negative? Harm is negative. Also law-rule? Disadvantage is not legal. So [emotions-negative].\n\n165. id: fbd84d36-595f-415a-ba92-abfeee21e66e, lemma: anārya, gloss: \"base-born, unaryan, dishonest\" -> Social-relations? Dishonest is social. Also law-rule? Dishonest is against rules. So [social-relations, law-rule].\n\n166. id: 15441083-d382-4fad-9e91-e3408bcb95da, lemma: anātha, gloss: \"want of a protector\" -> Social-relations? Lack of protector. Also emotions-negative? Want is negative. So [social-relations, emotions-negative].\n\n167. id: 3ff7957c-79f3-47d4-a02a-6589e92b4917, lemma: aṇḍa, gloss: \"an egg\" -> Animals? Egg is from animals. Also food-drink? Egg is food. So [animals, food-drink].\n\n168. id: 5226cd50-a7e4-47be-8e35-59005fbc730a, lemma: andha, gloss: \"blind, dark\" -> Senses? Blind is lack of sight. Also sky-weather? Dark is absence of light. So [senses, sky-weather].\n\n169. id: 4c5aa47d-1312-41b6-8e4e-d3ab4af22f06, lemma: andhas, gloss: \"the Soma plant or juice\" -> Plants-trees (plant) and food-drink (juice). So [plants-trees, food-drink].\n\n170. id: d893e4e1-4bb4-47e2-bf83-2e288da1f03d, lemma: andhas, gloss: \"a herb\" -> Plants-trees. [pla