re-will\"? 不。我认为\"social-relations\"合适。\n\n8. 1255787c-35be-48f9-8794-482e4ae1b543: anuśāsana - \"instruction, command\"\n   - 这属于\"speech-acts\"（Речевые акты）或\"law-rule\"（Право и управление）？指令/命令是一种言语行为。也可看作学习/教导？但\"learning\"类别是知识和学习？教导可以是\"learning\"的一部分。我更倾向于\"speech-acts\"因为是指令性言语。也可能是\"law-rule\"如果它指命令。我认为\"speech-acts\"合适。\n\n9. f947e66b-6ec4-457d-bfbd-1ee337ac6534: anuvāka - \"repeating\"\n   - 重复，可能是言语行动或行动。可以是\"speech-acts\"（重复说话）或\"physical-action\"? 但重复一般是言语行为。也可能是\"ritual-worship\"如果是在宗教仪式中重复咏诵？gloss只是\"repeating\"，没有语境。我认为\"speech-acts\"相对安全。\n\n10. b465bfc6-3b85-4959-acb2-84cbb302be2e: anuvṛtti - \"following, fulfilment (of duties)\"\n    - 履行职责可能涉及\"law-rule\"或\"social-relations\"或\"desire-will\"? \"following\"与前面的相似。\"fulfilment of duties\"更接近\"law-rule\"或\"social-relations\"? 也可能是\"rest-stillness\"? 不。我认为\"social-relations\"合理，因为职责是社会性的。\n\n11. 53b33ec5-bf68-43ba-a916-fee0d9e63532: anvaham - \"every day\"\n    - 这是关于时间的，时间频率。属于\"time-seasons\"（Время: части суток и сезоны）。是的。\n\n12. 68973a55-8b30-4081-b2d5-48d151b1422a: anvaya - \"connection, following, obedience, descendants\"\n    - \"connection\"可能涉及\"social-relations\"（关系），\"descendants\"是\"family-kin\"（Семья и родня）。\"obedience\"可能涉及\"law-rule\"？但主要含义是联系和后代。所以可能属于\"family-kin\"（后代）和\"social-relations\"（联系）。但注意gloss列出了多个含义。应选择最突出的。我认为\"family-kin\"和\"social-relations\"都合理。但由于是单个分类，可能需要选一个。类别列表中有\"family-kin\"和\"social-relations\"。可以选两者。我选择\"family-kin\"和\"social-relations\"。\n\n13. 20ce9932-55dc-449c-9081-57f7c0fc4049: anveṣaṇa - \"seeking for, inquiry\"\n    - 寻求/调查，属于\"thought-memory\"（思维）或\"learning\"（学习）？调查是知识获取。我认为\"learning\"更合适。\"thought-memory\"也可以。我选择\"learning\"。\n\n14. ec2edfb2-dfa5-4d7e-bb1e-a362a9b9f3e0: anyadā - \"at another time, at one time, once\"\n    - 时间相关，属于\"time-seasons\"。\n\n15. f34278be-bf59-42f0-9cc1-d75bd0f88004: anyatas - \"from elsewhere, elsewhere, on the one (on the other) side, otherwise\"\n    - 这是方向/位置相关。属于\"space-direction\"（Пространство и направление）。\"elsewhere\"表示地点，\"on the other side\"也是空间。也涉及\"otherwise\"表示方式，但主要空间。\n\n16. 024e3573-8f71-44e9-8a79-b17505d5c321: anyathā - \"otherwise\"\n    - 这表示方式/条件，不是明显的类别。可能\"question-answer\"? 不。可能\"space-direction\"? 不。可能\"time-seasons\"? 也不。更抽象。可能没有类别。或者属于\"thought-memory\"（思想上的其他方式）？犹豫。我认为空。\n\n17. d5a04dea-9f2f-410b-af04-ca26082cccee: anyatra - \"elsewhere, at another time, on another occasion, otherwise, in the other case\"\n    - 同样空间和时间。属于\"space-direction\"和\"time-seasons\"。gloss有多个含义。可能两者都选。\n\n18. c5939ee2-6d5a-4542-b881-1ac50893b87f: anyedyus - \"on the other day, on the following day\"\n    - 时间，属于\"time-seasons\"。\n\n19. 4d396a7f-0777-4c7e-904b-6cd971fc53cf: ap - \"water\"\n    - 明显属于\"water\"（Вода и реки）。\n\n20. c005138d-12a1-4da7-a818-044d714646e6: āp - \"to pervade, reach, obtain, win, get\"\n    - 这是动词，表示获得、到达、渗透。属于\"motion-verbs\"（Глаголы движения）？\"reach\"涉及运动。\"obtain\"可能属于\"desire-will\"? 但\"reach\"和\"pervade\"是物理动作。类别\"motion-verbs\"合适。也可能是\"physical-action\"（Физическое действие）。\"obtain\"也可视为动作。我选择\"motion-verbs\"和\"physical-action\"？但注意\"motion-verbs\"是专门类别。我认为\"motion-verbs\"更准确。也可以考虑\"physical-action\"。选择\"motion-verbs\"。\n\n现在总结每个翻译的类别ID。\n\n类别ID映射：\n- animals: 9b5819ef-1242-41ed-8e7a-45c13134d764\n- body-parts: 38e2cb5d-bd60-47bb-9550-305bdeb0ac5d\n- desire-will: 203c6b6c-12ff-457a-ad38-027d988f0389\n- emotions-negative: 1fe3ca1d-f512-4575-b44c-166db2d2c6f9\n- emotions-positive: 87a29f83-bf3c-4c89-9ea8-b029a7293b38\n- family-kin: b4654cca-3e0d-4d2c-aeff-dd74385c11de\n- food-drink: a9ead29c-db30-411b-a8d5-4613bc4dc85d\n- garments: afaede05-a838-406c-9ed6-34124d9ab28d\n- house-dwelling: 5957d31c-8847-4430-8d46-ccc2f1bf982b\n- landscape: 40e4b0d2-e448-4db1-badb-13e6179b3a20\n- law-rule: 728d7077-b7c7-487a-8b1b-92bc878fcdbb\n- learning: d267380c-57f2-4b91-883c-4313e45bc1ac\n- motion-verbs: 4613ce33-b55b-467e-9ee3-9208ac4d35c8\n- naming-address: f4ace08b-cfb5-471a-ba2b-40b379f17401\n- phi-moksha: d9470869-8cf4-42d2-9725-5e5ac30a9be1\n- physical-acti